{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/Welcome_to_Malware_City.png?t=1745357228\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/HUB_malware_city.gif?t=1745357228\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/Infect_your_way_to_the_root.png?t=1745357228\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/Pearlina_computer.gif?t=1745357228\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter various PCs, each one with its own Operative System and unique mechanics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/Elude_defense_mechanisms.png?t=1745357228\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/alien_enemy_malwarecity.gif?t=1745357228\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run from pesky anti-viruses and avoid all the hazards that each computer might hide! Jump between folders, sensitive information and hardware parts to traverse the world of Malware City!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/Destroy_computer_parts.png?t=1745357228\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/components.gif?t=1745357228\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every PC has its parts, and each part can be infected and destroyed! But be careful, every component behaves differently and has his own and unique protection system. Will you be able to destroy them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/Unlock_Minigames.png?t=1745357228\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/solitare_minigame.gif?t=1745357228\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some PCs may have hidden minigames inside them, collect them all and replay these classic gems freely in the Arcade!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/Reach_the_depth_of_the_deep_web.png?t=1745357228\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/DEEP_WEB.gif?t=1745357228\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Surf the most dangerous tides of the internet. Dodge deadly traps and other viruses, work your way back to your origins and face your creator!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3650510?t=1745357228","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/fb6f1e1fc7ae8a876f9d937f66b0cbbe7a06f596/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745357228","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/61beb47edcbb05fabc57abe934221a5fdf51de3b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745357228","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/61beb47edcbb05fabc57abe934221a5fdf51de3b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745357228","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/Welcome_to_Malware_City.png?t=1745357228\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/HUB_malware_city.gif?t=1745357228\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/Infect_your_way_to_the_root.png?t=1745357228\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/Pearlina_computer.gif?t=1745357228\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter various PCs, each one with its own Operative System and unique mechanics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/Elude_defense_mechanisms.png?t=1745357228\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/alien_enemy_malwarecity.gif?t=1745357228\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run from pesky anti-viruses and avoid all the hazards that each computer might hide! Jump between folders, sensitive information and hardware parts to traverse the world of Malware City!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/Destroy_computer_parts.png?t=1745357228\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650510/extras/components.gif?t=1745357228\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every PC has its parts, and ea